          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Stricter control over the chokepoint raises geopolitical and national‑security concerns among states, accelerating export controls, supply‑chain vetting and tighter rules on cross‑border AI-related technology transfers and investments." />
