          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sharp increase in asserted passage control (blockades, checkpoints, stricter rules of passage) forces allies to choose between military countermeasures and protecting energy/diplomatic links, producing visible policy splits and reducing coordinated allied responses on the Russia‑Ukraine file." />
