          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A spike in maritime incidents raises insurance premia and market volatility which prompts institutional and venture investors to pull back or delay funding rounds for higher‑burn AI firms, reducing available liquidity for AI organizations." />
