          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sustained rise in hostile incidents against commercial and naval vessels compels NATO/partner forces to redeploy and actively employ expendable interceptors to defend ships and forward bases in the Gulf, depleting inventories available for resupply to the Euro‑Atlantic air‑defense system." />
