          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained increases in drone attack activity drive accelerated government procurement and targeted subsidies for counter‑UAS sensors, munitions and related components, prompting firms to expand domestic production lines and capacity." />
