          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher volumes of commercially available drone platforms, sensors and spare parts moving through global trade (notably from China) enable private suppliers, contractors and start‑ups in the theater to procure, modify and supply unmanned systems at scale, increasing private sector integration into operations and logistics." />
