          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sustained rise in long-term nominal yields reduces the present value of long-horizon R&amp;D returns and convinces firms and institutional backers to cut or postpone ambitious, compute-intensive AI model development programs, slowing capability gains." />
