          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sustained rise in long-term sovereign yields raises government borrowing and debt‑service costs, shrinking fiscal space and prompting domestic political pressure to cut or delay foreign military assistance, which undermines sustained agreement and coordinated action among allies." />
