          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Directional pressure that weakens local currencies versus major suppliers raises the cost of imported sensors, motors and electronics for commercial drone producers, reducing production rates and thereby decreasing the frequency of unmanned attacks that rely on those commercial supply chains." />
